### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### REQUESTS WORKFLOW - Transaction System
### Base Route: api/Requests
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7010
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..Q2jA5PJdQpjOZ9F0wnU_2GCorgyE4UQlEIGWMeofAmQ

@requestId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@requesterId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@approverId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@templateId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@relationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 1. GET REQUEST BY ID
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2. GET PAGED REQUESTS
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Requests/paged
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 10,
  "fromDate": null,
  "toDate": null,
  "inputValueFilters": null,
  "logicalOperator": 1
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 3. GET REQUESTS BY REQUESTER ID (paged)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Requests/by-requester/{{requesterId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4. GET REQUESTS BY APPROVER ID (paged)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Requests/by-approver/{{approverId}}?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 5. GET REQUESTS BY TEMPLATE ID (paged)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Requests/by-template/{{templateId}}?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 6. GET PAGED REQUESTS NEED ACTION
### hasResponse: true = needs response, false = already has response
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Requests/GetPagedRequestsNeedAction/true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 7. GET MY PENDING REQUESTS (paged)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Requests/my-pending/paged?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 8. CREATE REQUEST (multipart/form-data)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="TemplateId"

{{templateId}}
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Content"; filename="blob"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "field1": "value1",
  "field2": "value2"
}
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Files"; filename="attachment.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./attachment.pdf
------Boundary--

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 9. GET RELATIONS BY REQUEST ID (NEW)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Requests/{{requestId}}/relations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 10. GET RELATION BY ID (NEW)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Requests/relations/{{relationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 11. DELETE REQUEST
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
